1
00:00:00,408 --> 00:00:04,038
(Howard:)...and demands you take her right there,
right now, you'll just walk away?

2
00:00:04,996 --> 00:00:07,666
(Leonard:)I said I'm her friend, not her gay friend.

3
00:00:10,627 --> 00:00:12,337
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

4
00:00:12,504 --> 00:00:14,504
Hey, I know you said
you didn't wanna talk...

5
00:00:14,673 --> 00:00:16,213
(Sheldon:)- I don't.
- Okay, sorry.

6
00:00:16,841 --> 00:00:19,301
(Leonard:)- Wait.
- Wait. Did you say wait?

7
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:22,803
(Penny:)Tell me the truth.

8
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:26,063
(Penny:)Am I just an idiot who picks giant losers?

9
00:00:26,226 --> 00:00:27,686
(Leonard:)No, no.

10
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:31,402
(Penny:)Okay, so I pick good guys,
but turn them into losers?

11
00:00:31,564 --> 00:00:32,604
(Leonard:)Of course not.

12
00:00:32,774 --> 00:00:35,734
Well, it's gotta be one or the other.
Which is it?

13
00:00:41,616 --> 00:00:43,996
(Leonard:)I'm sorry. What were the choices again?

14
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,290
(Penny:)I really thought Mike was different.

15
00:00:46,454 --> 00:00:49,544
(Penny:)I thought he was sensitive and smart.

16
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:50,708
(Penny:)I mean, not you smart.

17
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:54,045
(Penny:)- Normal non-freaky smart.
- Yeah, no, sure.

18
00:00:54,212 --> 00:00:56,882
(Penny:)You know, and then he just goes
and has to humiliate me...

19
00:00:57,048 --> 00:01:00,678
(Penny:)...by writing about me on his blog
so the entire world can read it.

